3. Yes, there are MANY predefined events
============================================


| Event                 | What causes it?                        |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `push`                | Code/tag is pushed                     |
| `pull_request`        | PR activity                            |
| `issues`              | Issue activity                         |
| `issue_comment`       | Comment on an issue/PR                 |
| `release`             | Release activity                       |
| `create`              | Branch/tag created                     |
| `delete`              | Branch/tag deleted                     |
| `fork`                | Repository forked                      |
| `workflow_dispatch`   | Human manually starts workflow         |
| `schedule`            | Scheduled time arrives                 |
| `workflow_run`        | Another workflow completes             |
| `workflow_call`       | Another workflow calls this workflow   |
| `repository_dispatch` | External system sends a dispatch event |


